#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:5
msgid "ペロブスカイトの擬立方格子"
msgstr "Pseudocubic Lattice of Perovskites"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:7
msgid ""
":ref:`単位胞の取り直し<lt-cell-transform>`\\ と\\ :ref:`胞の形とブラベー格子型<lt-cell-shape-"
"bravais>`\\ では、同じ格子を別の胞で表す例を見た。ここでは、少しだけ歪んだ結晶を、 "
"歪む前の高対称な結晶の軸で表す方法を扱う。この軸を使うと、相ごとに空間群の胞が違っても、格子定数や "
"方向の指数を共通の軸で比べられる。BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ を例に、擬立方胞と各相の慣用単位胞の関係、直方晶相での "
"格子定数の換算、擬立方表記で表せないことを順に見る。"
msgstr ""
"In :ref:`Changing the Unit Cell for FCC <lt-cell-transform>` \\ and \\ "
":ref:`Cell Shape and Bravais Lattice Type <lt-cell-shape-bravais>`\\ , we"
" saw how different cells can describe the same lattice. Here we describe "
"a slightly distorted crystal using the axes of the high-symmetry crystal "
"before distortion. These axes give a common basis for comparing lattice "
"constants and direction indices even when the conventional cells of the "
"space groups differ from phase to phase. Using BaTiO\\ :sub:`3` \\ as an "
"example, we relate the pseudocubic cell to each phase's conventional "
"cell, convert the lattice constants of the orthorhombic phase, and "
"describe the limits of pseudocubic notation."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:12
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`格子の基底変換<lt-primitive-basis>`、:ref:`方向と面の指数の変換<lt-index-"
"transform>`、 :ref:`等価な方向と面の族<equivalent-directions>`、:ref:`空間群<crystal-"
"space-group>`、 :ref:`R格子の六方軸表示<lt-rhombohedral-hexagonal>`。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: :ref:`Lattice basis transformations <lt-primitive-"
"basis>`, :ref:`transformations of direction and plane indices <lt-index-"
"transform>`, :ref:`families of equivalent directions and planes "
"<equivalent-directions>`, :ref:`space groups <crystal-space-group>`, and "
":ref:`the hexagonal setting of an R lattice <lt-rhombohedral-hexagonal>`."

