#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:67
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"どの相でも擬立方胞は基本単位胞の一つであり、慣用単位胞との違いは中心化と軸の取り方にある。直方晶相ではA中心化胞（:math:`|\\det "
"P|=2`）、菱面体晶相では六方軸の胞（:math:`|\\det P|=3`）が慣用単位胞になる。後者は\\ :ref:`R格子の節<lt-"
"rhombohedral-hexagonal>`\\ の :math:`P_{R,H}` で作る。辺の長さは "
":math:`a_{R,H}\\simeq\\sqrt2\\,a_{\\rm "
"pc}`、:math:`c_{R,H}\\simeq\\sqrt3\\,a_{\\rm pc}` で、:math:`\\boldsymbol "
"c_{R,H}=\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol "
"c_{\\rm pc}` が極性軸 :math:`[111]_{\\rm pc}` に沿う。"
msgstr ""
"In each phase the pseudocubic cell is a primitive cell. The conventional "
"cell differs in centering and choice of axes. The orthorhombic phase uses"
" an A-centered conventional cell (:math:`|\\det P|=2`), and the "
"rhombohedral phase uses a conventional cell in the hexagonal setting "
"(:math:`|\\det P|=3`). For the latter, use the matrix defined in the \\ "
":ref:`section on the R lattice <lt-rhombohedral-hexagonal>`\\ , "
":math:`P_{R,H}`. The edge lengths are "
":math:`a_{R,H}\\simeq\\sqrt2\\,a_{\\rm pc}` and "
":math:`c_{R,H}\\simeq\\sqrt3\\,a_{\\rm pc}`, and :math:`\\boldsymbol "
"c_{R,H}=\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol "
"c_{\\rm pc}` lies along the polar axis :math:`[111]_{\\rm pc}`."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:72
msgid "直方晶のA中心化胞との換算"
msgstr "Conversion to an A-Centered Orthorhombic Cell"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"空間群 :math:`Amm2` の標準の設定では、2回軸（極性軸）を :math:`c` 軸に取り、胞はA中心並進 "
":math:`(0,1/2,1/2)` を持つ。BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ の直方晶相では、2回軸は擬立方胞の面の対角線 "
":math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` に沿う。そこで"
msgstr ""
"In the standard setting of space group :math:`Amm2`, the twofold axis "
"(the polar axis) is the :math:`c` axis, and the cell has A-centering "
"translation :math:`(0,1/2,1/2)`. In the orthorhombic phase of BaTiO\\ "
":sub:`3`\\ , the twofold axis follows the face diagonal "
":math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` of the pseudocubic cell. We therefore choose"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm pc},\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm"
" pc},\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm"
" pc},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"P_{\\rm pc,orth}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&0&0\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&-1&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{\\rm pc,orth}=2"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm pc},\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm"
" pc},\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm orth}&=\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm"
" pc},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"P_{\\rm pc,orth}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1&0&0\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&-1&1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\det P_{\\rm pc,orth}=2"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と取る（:numref:`fig-pseudocubic-orthorhombic-"
"cell`）。直方晶の胞の体積は擬立方胞の2倍で、格子点を2個含む。A中心並進の分率座標を擬立方胞の基底へ移すと :math:`P_{\\rm "
"pc,orth}(0,1/2,1/2)^{\\mathsf T}=(0,1,0)^{\\mathsf T}` "
"で、:math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}` という格子並進になる。:ref:`FCCの基本単位胞<lt-fcc-"
"cell>`\\ への変換（:math:`\\det P_{\\rm "
"F}=1/4`）とは逆向きに、基本単位胞から中心化した慣用単位胞へ移る変換である。"
msgstr ""
"(see :numref:`fig-pseudocubic-orthorhombic-cell`). The orthorhombic cell "
"has twice the volume of the pseudocubic cell and contains two lattice "
"points. In the pseudocubic basis, the fractional coordinates of the "
"A-centering translation transform as :math:`P_{\\rm "
"pc,orth}(0,1/2,1/2)^{\\mathsf T}=(0,1,0)^{\\mathsf T}`, giving the "
"lattice translation :math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}`. This transformation"
" goes from a primitive cell to a centered conventional cell, in the "
"opposite direction to the transformation to the :ref:`FCC primitive cell "
"<lt-fcc-cell>` \\ (:math:`\\det P_{\\rm F}=1/4`)."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:91
msgid "格子点の並ぶ面で、青い破線のひし形が擬立方胞、オレンジの長方形が直方晶のA中心化胞。長方形の辺は擬立方胞の2本の辺の差と和で、長方形の中心にも格子点がある。"
msgstr ""
"In the plane of the lattice points, the blue dashed rhombus is the "
"pseudocubic cell and the orange rectangle is the A-centered orthorhombic "
"cell. The rectangle's edges are the difference and sum of two pseudocubic"
" cell edges. A lattice point also lies at the center of the rectangle."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm pc}` に垂直な面への投影。黒丸は格子点、青い矢印と破線のひし形は擬立方胞の "
":math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}`、:math:`\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc}`、オレンジの矢印と長方形は直方晶の胞の :math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm "
"orth}`、:math:`\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm orth}` を示す。白抜きの丸はA中心並進による格子点。 見やすさのため "
":math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}` を76°に誇張した（BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ では約89.9°）。"
msgstr ""
"Projection onto the plane perpendicular to :math:`\\boldsymbol a_{\\rm "
"pc}`. Filled black circles mark lattice points. The blue arrows and "
"dashed rhombus show :math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm pc}` of the pseudocubic cell. The orange "
"arrows and rectangle show :math:`\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm orth}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm orth}` of the orthorhombic cell. The open "
"circle marks the lattice point from the A-centering translation. For "
"clarity, :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}` is exaggerated to 76°. In BaTiO\\ "
":sub:`3` \\ it is about 89.9°."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"直方晶の胞の辺は互いに直交するので、計量行列 :math:`G_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{\\mathsf "
"T}G_{\\rm pc}P_{\\rm pc,orth}` は対角になる。:math:`G_{\\rm pc}=P_{\\rm "
"pc,orth}^{-\\mathsf T}G_{\\rm orth}P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{-1}` を計算すると、擬立方胞は "
":math:`b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}`、:math:`\\beta_{\\rm pc}=\\gamma_{\\rm "
"pc}=90^\\circ` で、:math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}` "
"だけが90°からずれる。胞の形は単斜だが、結晶の対称性は直方のままである。このとき"
msgstr ""
"The edges of the orthorhombic cell are mutually perpendicular, so the "
"metric matrix :math:`G_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{\\mathsf T}G_{\\rm "
"pc}P_{\\rm pc,orth}` is diagonal. Evaluating :math:`G_{\\rm pc}=P_{\\rm "
"pc,orth}^{-\\mathsf T}G_{\\rm orth}P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{-1}` gives "
":math:`b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}` and :math:`\\beta_{\\rm pc}=\\gamma_{\\rm"
" pc}=90^\\circ` for the pseudocubic cell, with only :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm "
"pc}` differing from 90°. The cell has a monoclinic shape, but the crystal"
" symmetry remains orthorhombic. In this case,"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:104
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"b_{\\rm orth}^2&=|\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc}|^2=2b_{\\rm pc}^2(1-\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc}),\\\\\n"
"c_{\\rm orth}^2&=|\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc}|^2=2b_{\\rm pc}^2(1+\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc})\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"b_{\\rm orth}^2&=|\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc}|^2=2b_{\\rm pc}^2(1-\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc}),\\\\\n"
"c_{\\rm orth}^2&=|\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc}|^2=2b_{\\rm pc}^2(1+\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc})\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:111
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"で、:math:`(\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm "
"pc})\\cdot(\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm pc})=b_{\\rm "
"pc}^2-c_{\\rm pc}^2=0` から2本の対角線は直交する。半角の公式で書き直し、逆に解いた式と並べると"
msgstr ""
"The two diagonals are perpendicular because :math:`(\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm "
"pc}-\\boldsymbol c_{\\rm pc})\\cdot(\\boldsymbol b_{\\rm pc}+\\boldsymbol"
" c_{\\rm pc})=b_{\\rm pc}^2-c_{\\rm pc}^2=0`. Using the half-angle "
"formulas and also solving for the pseudocubic parameters gives"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:113
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"b_{\\rm orth}&=2b_{\\rm pc}\\sin\\frac{\\alpha_{\\rm pc}}2,&\n"
"c_{\\rm orth}&=2b_{\\rm pc}\\cos\\frac{\\alpha_{\\rm pc}}2,\\\\\n"
"b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}&=\\frac{\\sqrt{b_{\\rm orth}^2+c_{\\rm "
"orth}^2}}2,&\n"
"\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc}&=\\frac{c_{\\rm orth}^2-b_{\\rm orth}^2}{c_{\\rm "
"orth}^2+b_{\\rm orth}^2}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"b_{\\rm orth}&=2b_{\\rm pc}\\sin\\frac{\\alpha_{\\rm pc}}2,&\n"
"c_{\\rm orth}&=2b_{\\rm pc}\\cos\\frac{\\alpha_{\\rm pc}}2,\\\\\n"
"b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}&=\\frac{\\sqrt{b_{\\rm orth}^2+c_{\\rm "
"orth}^2}}2,&\n"
"\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm pc}&=\\frac{c_{\\rm orth}^2-b_{\\rm orth}^2}{c_{\\rm "
"orth}^2+b_{\\rm orth}^2}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:123
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}=90^\\circ` なら :math:`b_{\\rm orth}=c_{\\rm "
"orth}=\\sqrt2\\,b_{\\rm pc}` である。擬立方の格子定数を :math:`\\sqrt2` 倍して直方晶の胞の "
":math:`b`、:math:`c` とする換算は、この極限で成り立つ。:math:`b_{\\rm orth}` と "
":math:`c_{\\rm orth}` の差は :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}` の90°からのずれに表れるので、長さを "
":math:`\\sqrt2` 倍するだけでは再現できない。"
msgstr ""
"When :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}=90^\\circ`, we get :math:`b_{\\rm "
"orth}=c_{\\rm orth}=\\sqrt2\\,b_{\\rm pc}`. Multiplying the pseudocubic "
"lattice constant by :math:`\\sqrt2` to recover :math:`b` and :math:`c` of"
" the orthorhombic cell is valid in this limit. The difference between "
":math:`b_{\\rm orth}` and :math:`c_{\\rm orth}` appears as the deviation "
"of :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}` from 90°, so simply multiplying the length "
"by :math:`\\sqrt2` cannot reproduce it."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:125
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"実測の格子定数で差の大きさを見積もる。Shiraneらの中性子回折による263 Kの構造は :math:`a_{\\rm orth}=3.990`"
" Å、:math:`b_{\\rm orth}=5.669` Å、:math:`c_{\\rm orth}=5.682` Å [`Shirane "
"1957 <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRev.105.856>`__]（値は\\ `AFLOWの結晶構造プロトタイプ"
" <https://aflow.org/p/AB3C_oC10_38_a_ae_b-002>`__\\ の記録から引用）。式 :eq"
":`pseudocubic-orthorhombic-lengths` から :math:`a_{\\rm pc}=3.990` "
"Å、:math:`b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}=4.013` Å、:math:`\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm "
"pc}=0.00229`、:math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}=89.87^\\circ` "
"を得る。:math:`\\sqrt2\\,b_{\\rm pc}=5.6755` Å は :math:`b_{\\rm orth}` "
"より0.0065 Å長く、:math:`c_{\\rm orth}` より0.0065 Å短い。擬立方の値 :math:`b_{\\rm "
"pc}=c_{\\rm pc}` だけを :math:`\\sqrt2` 倍して戻すと、約0.2%ある :math:`b` と :math:`c`"
" の差が消える。"
msgstr ""
"Use measured lattice constants to estimate the size of the difference. "
"The structure at 263 K measured by Shirane and coauthors using neutron "
"diffraction has :math:`a_{\\rm orth}=3.990` Å, :math:`b_{\\rm "
"orth}=5.669` Å, and :math:`c_{\\rm orth}=5.682` Å [`Shirane 1957 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRev.105.856>`__] (values from the \\ `AFLOW "
"crystal structure prototype "
"<https://aflow.org/p/AB3C_oC10_38_a_ae_b-002>`__ \\ record). Equation :eq"
":`pseudocubic-orthorhombic-lengths` gives :math:`a_{\\rm pc}=3.990` Å, "
":math:`b_{\\rm pc}=c_{\\rm pc}=4.013` Å, :math:`\\cos\\alpha_{\\rm "
"pc}=0.00229`, and :math:`\\alpha_{\\rm pc}=89.87^\\circ`. The result "
":math:`\\sqrt2\\,b_{\\rm pc}=5.6755` Å is 0.0065 Å longer than "
":math:`b_{\\rm orth}` and 0.0065 Å shorter than :math:`c_{\\rm orth}`. "
"Converting back using only the pseudocubic value :math:`b_{\\rm "
"pc}=c_{\\rm pc}` multiplied by :math:`\\sqrt2` erases the difference of "
"about 0.2% between :math:`b` and :math:`c`."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"方向と面の指数は、:ref:`方向と面の指数の変換則<lt-index-transform>`\\ どおり :math:`\\boldsymbol"
" u_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{-1}\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm "
"pc}`、:math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{\\mathsf "
"T}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm pc}` で移る。極性軸 :math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` は "
":math:`[001]_{\\rm orth}`、:math:`[01\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}` は "
":math:`[010]_{\\rm orth}` である。面 :math:`(011)_{\\rm pc}` は "
":math:`(002)_{\\rm orth}` になり、同じ逆格子ベクトルを表す。逆に :math:`(001)_{\\rm orth}` は"
" :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm pc}=(0,1/2,1/2)` で整数にならず、逆格子点ではない。これは "
":math:`k+l` が奇数の反射が消えるA中心の反射条件にあたり、\\ :ref:`中心並進のある胞の逆格子<centred-"
"reciprocal-lattice>`\\ の条件 :eq:`centred-reciprocal-condition` を "
":math:`T=\\{(0,0,0),(0,1/2,1/2)\\}` に当てはめたものである。"
msgstr ""
"Following the :ref:`transformation rules for direction and plane indices "
"<lt-index-transform>`\\ , the indices transform as :math:`\\boldsymbol "
"u_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{-1}\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm pc}` and "
":math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm orth}=P_{\\rm pc,orth}^{\\mathsf "
"T}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm pc}`. The polar axis :math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` "
"becomes :math:`[001]_{\\rm orth}`, and :math:`[01\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}` "
"becomes :math:`[010]_{\\rm orth}`. The plane :math:`(011)_{\\rm pc}` "
"becomes :math:`(002)_{\\rm orth}`, representing the same reciprocal "
"lattice vector. Conversely, :math:`(001)_{\\rm orth}` gives "
":math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm pc}=(0,1/2,1/2)`, whose components are not "
"all integers, so it does not correspond to a reciprocal lattice point. "
"This is the A-centering reflection condition, which forbids reflections "
"with odd :math:`k+l`. To obtain this rule, take the condition for the \\ "
":ref:`reciprocal lattice of a cell with centering translations <centred-"
"reciprocal-lattice>` \\  in Equation :eq:`centred-reciprocal-condition` "
"and apply it to :math:`T=\\{(0,0,0),(0,1/2,1/2)\\}`."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:132
msgid "空間群の設定による軸の名前の違い"
msgstr "Axis Names in Different Space Group Settings"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"上の :math:`P_{\\rm pc,orth}` は :math:`Amm2` の標準の設定を前提にしている。同じ空間群型（No. "
"38）は、軸の名前の付け方によって "
":math:`Amm2`、:math:`Bmm2`、:math:`B2mm`、:math:`C2mm`、:math:`Cm2m`、:math:`Am2m`"
" とも書ける（International Tables for Crystallography, Vol. A (2006), `Table "
"4.3.2.1 <https://it.iucr.org/Ab/ch4o3v0001/table4o3o2o1.pdf>`__）。例えば "
":math:`C2mm` の設定では極性軸が :math:`a` 軸、擬立方胞の辺と同じ長さの軸が :math:`c` "
"軸になり、:math:`P` "
"の列が入れ替わる。文献や構造ファイルの「:math:`b`」「:math:`c`」がどの物理的な方向の長さかは設定で変わるので、設定の違う文献の "
":math:`b` どうしを並べると、別の方向の長さを比べることになりうる。空間群の記号から擬立方胞との対応 :math:`P` "
"を決めれば、同じ物理的な方向どうしを対応づけられる。"
msgstr ""
"The matrix :math:`P_{\\rm pc,orth}` above assumes the standard setting "
":math:`Amm2`. The same space group type (No. 38) can be written as "
":math:`Amm2`, :math:`Bmm2`, :math:`B2mm`, :math:`C2mm`, :math:`Cm2m`, or "
":math:`Am2m`, depending on how the axes are named (International Tables "
"for Crystallography, Vol. A (2006), `Table 4.3.2.1 "
"<https://it.iucr.org/Ab/ch4o3v0001/table4o3o2o1.pdf>`__). For example, in"
" the :math:`C2mm` setting, the polar axis is the :math:`a` axis and the "
"axis whose length equals the pseudocubic edge length is the :math:`c` "
"axis, so the columns of :math:`P` are permuted. In papers or structure "
"files, the physical directions associated with the lengths “:math:`b`” "
"and “:math:`c`” depend on the setting. Comparing values of :math:`b` from"
" papers that use different settings can therefore compare lengths in "
"different directions. Use the space group symbol to determine the mapping"
" :math:`P` to the pseudocubic cell and match the same physical "
"directions."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:139
msgid "擬立方表記で表せないこと"
msgstr "Limitations of Pseudocubic Notation"

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"擬立方の指数は、歪んだ相の方向を高温相の立方胞の軸で名付ける。:ref:`等価な方向の族<equivalent-directions>`\\ "
"は低温相の点群で決まるので、擬立方表記の族は厳密な等価性を表さない。例えば「擬立方の "
":math:`\\langle100\\rangle`」は、立方晶の点群 :math:`m\\bar3m` "
"で等価だった6方向の名前である。正方晶相（点群 :math:`4mm`）では、6方向は極性軸の向き :math:`[001]_{\\rm "
"pc}`、その逆向き :math:`[00\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}`、残りの4方向という3つの族に分かれる。強誘電体の分極が「擬立方の "
":math:`\\langle100\\rangle` を向く」とは、6方向のうち1つが選ばれた状態をいう。分極の向きがそろった領域を\\ "
":ref:`分域<ferroelectric-domains>`\\ （ドメイン）といい、隣り合う分域では6方向のうち別の方向が選ばれている。"
msgstr ""
"Pseudocubic indices name directions in the distorted phase using the axes"
" of the cubic cell of the high-temperature phase. The :ref:`families of "
"equivalent directions <equivalent-directions>` \\ are determined by the "
"point group of the low-temperature phase, so pseudocubic families do not "
"indicate exact equivalence. For example, “pseudocubic "
":math:`\\langle100\\rangle`” names six directions that were equivalent "
"under the cubic point group :math:`m\\bar3m`. In the tetragonal phase "
"(point group :math:`4mm`), the six directions split into three families: "
"the polar direction :math:`[001]_{\\rm pc}`, its reverse "
":math:`[00\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}`, and the other four directions. Polarization"
" along “pseudocubic :math:`\\langle100\\rangle`” in a ferroelectric means"
" that one of the six directions has been selected. A region with a "
"uniform polarization direction is called a \\ :ref:`domain "
"<ferroelectric-domains>`\\ . Neighboring domains select different "
"directions from the six."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"直方晶相（点群 :math:`mm2`）では、立方晶で :math:`\\langle110\\rangle` "
"だった12方向が5つの族に分かれる。極性軸 :math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` とその逆向き "
":math:`[0\\bar1\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}` はそれぞれ単独の族で、:math:`\\pm[01\\bar1]_{\\rm "
"pc}` が1つの族、残りの8方向が4方向ずつ2つの族になる。「分極は擬立方の :math:`\\langle110\\rangle` "
"を向く」は、この12方向のうち1つが極性軸として選ばれたことを表す。"
msgstr ""
"In the orthorhombic phase (point group :math:`mm2`), the twelve cubic "
":math:`\\langle110\\rangle` directions split into five families. The "
"polar direction :math:`[011]_{\\rm pc}` and its reverse "
":math:`[0\\bar1\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}` each form a family of one, "
":math:`\\pm[01\\bar1]_{\\rm pc}` forms one family, and the other eight "
"directions form two families of four each. “Polarization points along "
"pseudocubic :math:`\\langle110\\rangle`” means that one of the twelve "
"directions has been selected as the polar axis."

#: ../../solid/pseudocubic.rst:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"擬立方胞が基本単位胞になるのは、BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ "
"の各相のように並進周期が立方相と同じ場合に限る。隣り合う酸素八面体が互いに逆向きに回転する相では、並進周期が擬立方胞の辺の2倍になる方向が現れる "
"[`Glazer 1972 <https://doi.org/10.1107/S0567740872007976>`__, `Howard & "
"Stokes 1998 <https://doi.org/10.1107/S0108768198004200>`__]。例えばGdFeO\\ "
":sub:`3`\\ 型の :math:`Pnma` の胞は :math:`a\\simeq c\\simeq\\sqrt2\\,a_{\\rm "
"pc}`、:math:`b\\simeq2a_{\\rm pc}` "
"で、4化学式単位を含む。このとき擬立方胞の辺は格子並進でなく、擬立方胞は単位胞にならない。擬立方の格子定数は、長さと角度を立方胞の軸で読むための参照として使われる。"
msgstr ""
"The pseudocubic cell is a primitive cell only when the translational "
"periodicity is the same as in the cubic phase, as it is in the phases of "
"BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ . In phases where neighboring oxygen octahedra rotate "
"in opposite senses, some directions have a translational period twice the"
" pseudocubic cell edge length [`Glazer 1972 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1107/S0567740872007976>`__, `Howard & Stokes 1998 "
"<https://doi.org/10.1107/S0108768198004200>`__]. For example, the GdFeO\\"
" :sub:`3`\\ -type :math:`Pnma` cell has :math:`a\\simeq "
"c\\simeq\\sqrt2\\,a_{\\rm pc}` and :math:`b\\simeq2a_{\\rm pc}` and "
"contains four formula units. In this case the pseudocubic edges are not "
"lattice translations, and the pseudocubic cell is not a unit cell. The "
"pseudocubic lattice constants serve as a reference for interpreting "
"lengths and angles in terms of the cubic axes."

